		{"id":"bd596be2cbd738ac","type":"text","text":"## Recognize the sequence\n```python\nnext_char, next_timestamp = next_event = peek()\nseq.append(next_event)\n```\nCompare `delta = time() - next_timestamp` and `CTRLSEQ_TIMEOUT`","x":-1785,"y":-20,"width":250,"height":346},
